{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13209210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13209210","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1320921001:0":{"text":"So, did you find that spirit?","source_cn":"怎么样，你们找到那个女幽灵了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x927516E75324E65C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320921002:0":{"text":"We did! She asked us to move her grave to Cedartown, and we promised to help her.","source_cn":"找到啦！而且我们还答应帮她完成心愿，把她的坟墓从这里迁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0F77A3A12E352F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320921003:1":{"text":"Move her grave?! That's...","source_cn":"迁走坟墓？！这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7102517FE4B20B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1320921003":{"text":"Move her grave?! That's...","source_cn":"迁走坟墓？！这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7102517FE4B20B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320921005:0":{"text":"*Sigh* Look, let me be upfront. In Cedartown, we have a tradition of burying the dead together so us tomb guardians can keep an eye on them. If any undead show up, we can deal with them fast.","source_cn":"唉，说实话吧。雪松镇的本地习俗就是把死者葬在一起，方便...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDED9658295544B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320921006:0":{"text":"As for the temple burial grounds in town, it's surrounded by houses. To keep the dead there from turning, only acolytes and those blessed by the goddess are buried there. They're protected from becoming undead.","source_cn":"至于镇上的教堂墓地，那周围有不少民居。为了防止那片墓地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6CE859AB8C1B6C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320921007:1":{"text":"Wait, does that mean we can't move the spirit lady's grave there?","source_cn":"这么说来，幽灵大婶就不能安葬在那边了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BFF1BE09EEE155","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320921008:1":{"text":"Sir, isn't there any way around this? She's not an undead, she just wants to be near her son!","source_cn":"巡墓人叔叔，就不能破例一次吗？幽灵大婶不是活死人，她只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B9EFE5DABD939EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320921009:1":{"text":"Sorry, but it's not that simple. She is a spirit, after all...","source_cn":"恐怕不行，毕竟她是幽灵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C1266FE6B0E47C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320921010:0":{"text":"...Wait. If she's already a spirit, isn't it impossible for her to turn into an undead?","source_cn":"……等等。既然她已经是幽灵，是不是就没可能再变成活死人了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE36BA39DC9B987A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320921011:0":{"text":"Hmm, technically, yes. Once someone becomes a spirit, that means their soul has left their body entirely.","source_cn":"唔，从理论上来说是的。毕竟变成幽灵就代表灵魂已经彻底脱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA69AC187BC223D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320921012:1":{"text":"If that's the case... fine, you can move her grave.","source_cn":"既然这样……那好吧，你们就把她的坟墓迁过去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63EEB4B3D416D8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320921013:0":{"text":"But I'll need her name for the records, just to make sure everything's in order.","source_cn":"你们知道她的名字吧？我得记录一下，免得后面又出什么问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48FB4B799D1890BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320921014:0":{"text":"Her name is Ksenia!","source_cn":"当然知道，幽灵大婶叫克谢尼娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EF51050970A5C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320921015:1":{"text":"Ksenia, huh... There are at least three graves here with that name.","source_cn":"克谢尼娅……我记得这墓园里至少有三个人都叫这个名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4CDD39A134BCD26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320921016:0":{"text":"What?! How do we know which one is hers, then?","source_cn":"啊？！这、这我们要怎么确定哪个才是我们要找的人啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE77611334283E5AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320921017:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">Check the epitaphs</style>. Families usually make them unique to avoid confusion.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>看看墓志铭</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87A1482091D668A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"What's the matter?","source_cn":"怎么了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB30C0F577CCF3052","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's the matter?","female":"What's the matter?","variant_male_record_index":"69428","variant_female_record_index":"69429","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320921004:0":{"text":"Well, it is allowed. It's just that...","source_cn":"这倒是没有。只不过……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9F832E4EDD90F7ED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Well, it is allowed. It's just that...","female":"Well, it is allowed. It's just that...","variant_male_record_index":"148169","variant_female_record_index":"148170","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"Moving graves is allowed, right?","source_cn":"该不会不允许迁坟吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA7797608C47FD1F3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Moving graves is allowed, right?","female":"Moving graves is allowed, right?","variant_male_record_index":"69430","variant_female_record_index":"69431","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:巡墓人齐诺维":{"text":"Zinovi","source":"巡墓人齐诺维","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑙姆":{"text":"Naum","source":"瑙姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":4}}